# review-skills config -- KEY=VALUE, one per line. Keep this file mode 600: it holds API keys.
# The environment beats this file. Only the keys below (and other PR_REVIEW_* / PEER_REVIEW_* /
# OLLAMA_* / AGY_DO_* knobs from the SKILL.md files) are read; anything else is ignored.
# `review-skills doctor` shows what is set (never the values) and which models will run.

# --- Backends. Any one is enough; each one added widens the choice of models. ---------------
# claude: sign in with `claude auth login` (subscription). To bill an API key instead:
# ANTHROPIC_USE_API_KEY=1
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=
# agy (Gemini): sign in with agy itself; it takes no key.
# ollama.com: hosted open models (glm, kimi, ...). The diff leaves your machine when used.
# OLLAMA_API_KEY=

# --- Models. auto (default) picks the best reachable from lib/models.tsv; manual takes its first rows.
# REVIEW_SKILLS_MODELS=auto
# Pins, as transport:model[@effort], space-separated for several finders:
# PR_REVIEW_FINDERS=anthropic:claude-opus-5-5@xhigh
# PR_REVIEW_REFUTER=agy:gemini-3.8-flash-high
# PR_REVIEW_INTENSE_FINDERS=anthropic:claude-opus-5-5@max agy:gemini-3.8-flash-high
# PR_REVIEW_INTENSE_REFUTER=ollama:glm-5.3-flash

# --- Where reviews are kept: <store>/<author>/<repo>/<N>/. Intense: <store>/_intense/... -----
# PR_REVIEW_DIR=~/.reviews

# --- Fix PRs. PR authors (GitHub logins, space- or comma-separated) whose confirmed findings
# get a companion fix PR instead of a report. Empty: never. -------------------------------
# PR_REVIEW_FIX_AUTHORS=

# --- Which diff files are tests (reviewed in their own pass) and which earn a cross-cutting
# pass. Defaults suit Dart; extended regexes matched against the file path. -----------------
# PR_REVIEW_TEST_RE=(^|/)tests?/|_test\.dart$
# PR_REVIEW_CROSS_RE=(pubspec\.yaml|/lib/[^/]+\.dart)$

# --- Learning. A Markdown file (optional front-matter `description:`) pinned once as a rule the
# request-changes body writer follows. Default: posting-style.md beside this file, if present.
# PR_REVIEW_LEARN_SEED=~/.config/review-skills/posting-style.md
# PR_REVIEW_LEARN=off
